== Archery and Haste ==

Worn haste, spell haste, and bard song haste affect bow delay the same way they affect melee delay.

=== Quiver Haste ===

A quiver provides quiver haste when placed in the top-level inventory. If multiple quivers are carried, only the first applicable quiver is used.

An arrow is '''not''' required inside the quiver. An empty quiver provides the same haste as a quiver containing arrows. Only the container type matters.

This was confirmed by EQL developer [[Secrets]] on Discord on September 25, 2026:

'''"Haste from Quivers is not dependent on the contents, only the container type."'''

[https://discord.com/channels/1435786469968183456/1483589348027793408/1553133192842580070 Developer confirmation]

Quiver haste can be estimated from weight reduction:

'''Quiver Haste = Weight Reduction / 3'''

Quiver haste reduces bow delay before other haste is applied, so it is not affected by ordinary haste caps.

