== Player Quiver Test ==

=== Test Conditions ===

Testing took place on September 28th, 2026 in the arena against a level 35 [[Test Dummy]] using a level 50 SHD/RNG/WIZ with no buffs, 142% displayed attack speed with the 42% haste from [[Cloak of Flames]] +6. The setup used a [[Windstriker]] +5, [[Mithril Champion Arrows]] +0, and a [[Fleeting Quiver]] listed at 20% haste.

The first three rounds lasted about two minutes per setup, the fourth lasted about five minutes, and the fifth lasted ten minutes. Each percentage compares that setup with the no-quiver result from the same round.

